After dinner, I call my family in Mexico.
I sit on the couch with my computer.
My sister, Sofía, answers.
"Hi Maya!" she says happily.
In the background, I see my brother, Diego.
He waves to me.
Suddenly, we hear a sound.
It is our dog, Lola.
She barks at the screen.
"Lola misses you too," Sofía laughs.
I smile brightly.
Then I tell them about my day.
I talk about my work and my lunch in the canteen.
I also tell them about my sweet neighbor, Nina.
It is lovely to see my family.
I always look forward to our video calls.
